    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433500/extras/34429c1dc4649a0cfdbd8189625b0bc8.avif?t=1684238741\" /></span><br>You take a suspiciously appetizing contract despite being a bit new to how business goes in space. Biting off more than you can chew resulted in having serious threat to your existence.<br>Now you will have to grow your power to adapt and overcome this mess. You have some allies, but it's not going to be easy getting out a chase that turned into persecution.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433500/extras/38c8f5c51595e81363c6e0ce8c53d0e1.poster.avif?t=1684238741\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433500/extras/38c8f5c51595e81363c6e0ce8c53d0e1.webm?t=1684238741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433500/extras/38c8f5c51595e81363c6e0ce8c53d0e1.mp4?t=1684238741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Constant gameplay variety.</strong><br>Cosmic Persecution features shifts between runner, platformer, survival and puzzle objectives. Each with battles which you won't get past.<br><br></li><li><strong>Make optimal decisions.</strong><br>Some of the levels will require a more tactical approach while giving you specific target, others will feature nonlinear structure, allowing you to choose your path.<br><br></li><li><strong>Imposing Arsenal.</strong><br>Lots of elaborately designed futuristic firearms and energy weapons, each serving its own purpose.<br><br></li><li><strong>Parkour elements.</strong><br>Use air maneuvers, sliding and crouching to evade obstacles and enemy attacks. Choose a character, which air mobility capabilities suit your playstyle most.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433500/extras/34429c1dc4649a0cfdbd8189625b0bc8.avif?t=1684238741\" /></span><br>You take a suspiciously appetizing contract despite being a bit new to how business goes in space. Biting off more than you can chew resulted in having serious threat to your existence.<br>Now you will have to grow your power to adapt and overcome this mess. You have some allies, but it's not going to be easy getting out a chase that turned into persecution.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433500/extras/38c8f5c51595e81363c6e0ce8c53d0e1.poster.avif?t=1684238741\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433500/extras/38c8f5c51595e81363c6e0ce8c53d0e1.webm?t=1684238741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433500/extras/38c8f5c51595e81363c6e0ce8c53d0e1.mp4?t=1684238741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Constant gameplay variety.</strong><br>Cosmic Persecution features shifts between runner, platformer, survival and puzzle objectives. Each with battles which you won't get past.<br><br></li><li><strong>Make optimal decisions.</strong><br>Some of the levels will require a more tactical approach while giving you specific target, others will feature nonlinear structure, allowing you to choose your path.<br><br></li><li><strong>Imposing Arsenal.</strong><br>Lots of elaborately designed futuristic firearms and energy weapons, each serving its own purpose.<br><br></li><li><strong>Parkour elements.</strong><br>Use air maneuvers, sliding and crouching to evade obstacles and enemy attacks. Choose a character, which air mobility capabilities suit your playstyle most.</li></ul>",
